{'symbol': 'CL', 'date': '2023-05-01 09:41:00', 'title': 'COLGATE-PALMOLIVE WEBCASTS 2023 ANNUAL MEETING OF STOCKHOLDERS MAY 12, 2023 – 10:00 A.M. ET', 'text': 'NEW YORK--(BUSINESS WIRE)--COLGATE-PALMOLIVE COMPANY (NYSE:CL) WILL PROVIDE A LIVE VIDEO WEBCAST OF ITS 2023 ANNUAL MEETING OF STOCKHOLDERS ON FRIDAY, MAY 12, 2023 AT 10:00 A.M. ET. THE MEETING, WHICH WILL BE HELD VIRTUALLY, WILL BE HOSTED BY NOEL WALLACE, CHAIRMAN, PRESIDENT AND CEO. INVESTORS MAY ACCESS THE LIVE VIDEO WEBCAST AT WWW.VIRTUALSHAREHOLDERMEETING.COM/CL2023. ACCESS WILL BE AVAILABLE BEGINNING AT 9:30 A.M. ET. FOR THOSE UNABLE TO PARTICIPATE DURING THE LIVE WEBCAST, A RECORDED VERS.'}